endly clerics and their","associated druid cousins.","","Several weeks past, however,","a war group consisting of","chaotic mages and their","warrior bodyguards invaded","the region and magically","corrupted all the innocent","folk.  The clerics, now","under control of the mages,","have been summoning forth ","hordes of undead to terrorize","the locals.","","I fear we must not only","destroy the foul mages and","their minions, but most ","likely the poor clerics as","well."],"map":{"width":60,"height":58,"tiles":[16,18,1,17,63,59,59,59,17,1,16,18,57,57,57,57,18,18,18,17,18,17,16,16,16,16,18,1,1,1,57,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,95,16,17,17,18,16,17,18,1,16,18,1,16,1,18,17,16,17,17,16,1,18,63,59,59,59,60,1,17,57,57,57,58,56,56,80,57,1,18,1,18,1,16,17,16,16,18,16,16,1,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,96,18,1,1,18,1,16,16,1,16,16,17,17,67,17,17,17,17,16,16,17,59,59,59,60,17,18,1,57,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,16,16,16,17,18,63,62,17,1,1,18,18,57,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,96,17,16,17,16,18,18,17,1,1,18,16,1,16,16,16,18,18,17,16,1,18,17,18,17,16,16,57,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,57,18,16,16,16,59,59,16,16,16,16,57,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,96,1,18,17,18,18,1,1,1,16,16,1,1,1,16,1,1,17,1,18,1,17,17,1,17,16,18,55,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,55,83,18,18,1,59,59,62,18,18,18,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,94,16,16,1,18,16,18,17,17,16,16,18,17,17,1,16,18,18,16,16,16,1,16,18,1,17,1,84,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,88,94,1,1,74,59,59,59,16,18,17,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,57,17,16,16,18,1,17,18,18,16,18,18,18,1,1,17,17,16,17,17,16,17,18,17,17,18,1,16,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,55,95,16,18,18,1,59,59,59,1,18,16,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,83,17,18,17,18,1,1,1,18,18,1,16,17,17,1,16,1,18,1,16,1,18,16,16,1,18,57,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,86,94,18,17,18,16,59,59,60,18,1,17,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,95,16,18,17,17,16,17,16,16,16,17,17,1,18,17,1,16,1,1,1,18,18,16,17,16,16,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,80,55,96,18,1,18,17,18,59,59,18,16,17,1,58,56,56,56,56,56,56,56,5